        "description": "Every member who can read Usage (owner, admin, developer, billing, viewer) of an active workspace. Charge amounts are returned to owner and billing only; other roles receive usage.charges null. Days are UTC calendar days ending today; the previous period is the same number of whole days before it, and previous values are given for live scopes only (test content is kept 30 days). A session belongs to the day its first turn was admitted and to the key (or console Sandbox) that opened it, and counts once it has a completed turn. Every figure comes from sessions still kept: discarded sessions, erased learners and content past retention are not counted. Free test attempts remain the trial-allowance read of each listing in listing_ids. More than 100,000 sessions in scope in the window (the period, and for live scopes the previous period) answers 422 DEVELOPER_REPORTING_TOO_LARGE: too much activity for this period; choose 7 days or one key.",
