        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "JWT",
        "description": "Clerk session from the configured instance/authorized party. Second factor is required for all requests; POST requires second-factor age <=10 minutes. Current DB roles and live team membership remain authoritative. Handle DEVELOPER_MFA_REQUIRED and DEVELOPER_STEP_UP_REQUIRED without changing operation_id."
      }
    },
