  "title": "Developer runtime request and response schemas",
  "description": "Source-observed Developer Platform wire at cb392073; distinct from shared chat. Extra fields are refused in requests. Response schemas describe the known producer; clients must tolerate future response fields and event types. Runtime-only byte, UTF-16, scope, ordering and identity constraints remain authoritative.",
  "$defs": {
